OL,3,GNEWSAFour people rescued due to rising
OL,4,Atides
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people had to be rescued after
OL,7,Fbeing stranded by rising tides in two
OL,8,Fcall-outs on the same day.
OL,10,FSeahouses RNLI volunteers and the
OL,11,FBerwick Coastguard rescued two men from
OL,12,Fa car after it got stuck near the Holy
OL,13,FIsland causeway, near to the refuge
OL,14,Fhut, at 15:48 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FEarlier that day the teams had already
OL,17,Fcome to the aid of a man and child who
OL,18,Fhad become trapped on a sand bank due
OL,19,Fto high tides at Budle Bay.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
